#ASSERT `s 12(2)(b) the claim is made by an employee in a prescribed class against a person liable under section 65 of the Employment Act 1968` `The employee` `A person liable under section 65 of the Employment Act 1968 for the employee's salary` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(b) the claim is made by an employee in a prescribed class against a person liable under section 65 of the Employment Act 1968` `The employee` `A person liable under section 65 of the Employment Act 1968 for the employee's salary` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(b) the claim is made by an employee in a prescribed class against a person liable under section 65 of the Employment Act 1968` `The employee` `The employer of the employee` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

