#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employer` `An employee of the employer` `first sch item 17` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE  -- (i)
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employer` `An employee of the employer` `second sch item 14` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE  -- (i)
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employer` `An employee of the employer` `second sch item 13` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE  -- (ii): prescribed
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employer` `An employee of the employer` `second sch item 13` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employer` `An employee of the employer` `second sch item 13` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employer` `An employee of the employer` `first sch item 17` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- not a prescribed class of employers
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employer` `An employee of the employer` `first sch item 17` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 12(2)(c) the claim is made by an employer in a prescribed class against an employee about a matter the paragraph names` `The employee` `The employer of the employee` `first sch item 17` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- an employee cannot bring it
